SVM out/inout reproducer
========================

Audit item #16 claims `out`/`inout` parameter modes silently lose
mutations on the SVM backend. This file probes whether that's still
true post-Tier-2; the same source runs on every backend and the
test runner reports per-backend pass/fail.

    module sysl.tests.outparam_test


    set_to_42(out x: int) -> unit
        x = 42

    inc(inout x: int) -> unit
        x = x + 1


    #test
    test_out_param() -> unit
        var y = 0
        set_to_42(y)
        assert(y == 42, "out param should mutate y to 42")

    #test
    test_inout_increment() -> unit
        var z = 100
        inc(z)
        assert(z == 101, "inout param should mutate z")
